== Vocabulary ==
The lexicon of Burawi is a fusion of native [[Burano-Ormaic languages|Burano-Ormaic]] roots and three distinct foreign layers:
* '''Mesogean Layer (Old)''': Ancient trade vocabulary (Science, Law).
* '''Darasian Layer (Fosian)''': Revolutionary socialist terminology adopted in the 1930s.
* '''Volisanian Layer (Modern)''': State and military terms from the occupation era.

